Z||000006||mshill||09-30-2000||01:43 PM||||I thought it looked OK until I saw the shot from behind.  What's with the stacked up exhaust?  I think they were trying to be like<BR>the Boxster.  I looks like an over-under shotgun sticking out the back.  I think the Boxter single oval tip in the middle of the back is really cool, but the over-under on the speedster just kills the backend of the car.||||reg||1
